New package: SharpTS.SharpTS.NativeAOT version @VERSION@

Add the SharpTS Native AOT distribution as a ZIP/portable package for Windows x64 and ARM64.
Each archive has the root-level `sharpts.exe`, `LICENSE` and `README.md`. The portable command
is `sharpts`; the package declares no .NET installation dependency.

This is the Native AOT CLI with its documented closed interop surface. Arbitrary DLL/NuGet references, --verify, --gen-decl and compiled child_process.fork require the managed SKU. Executing emitted managed DLLs needs a compatible .NET host.

Release: https://github.com/nickna/SharpTS/releases/tag/v@VERSION@

- x64: https://github.com/nickna/SharpTS/releases/download/v@VERSION@/sharpts-native-@VERSION@-win-x64.zip
- ARM64: https://github.com/nickna/SharpTS/releases/download/v@VERSION@/sharpts-native-@VERSION@-win-arm64.zip

The manifest generator computed SHA-256 values from the actual public archives and checked their
layout, architecture and available GitHub asset digests. Both SharpTS SKUs share the command name;
the documented switching procedure uninstalls the current identity first.

Actual validation evidence: @VALIDATION_EVIDENCE_URL@

That evidence must cover schema validation, native x64/ARM64 installer selection, local installation,
version and interpreter/compiler smokes, command discovery from a fresh terminal, uninstall cleanup,
both switching directions and the upstream sandbox test. Do not submit this draft with missing
results or placeholders. Apply the current upstream PR checklist and complete its CLA requirements.

Upstream tracking: https://github.com/nickna/SharpTS/issues/1356
